{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は握手かいに来てくれてありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも来てくださる方や、はじめての方！お久しぶりの方！\nお話しできて、皆様の顔が見れてっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても幸せでした(*´∀｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかったて方！つぎきてよねっ？(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってるからっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねっ正直ねっ...\nまあやねっ......\n時々、広島の事を思い出してホームシックになったりするんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもよく考えたらそんなのは当たり前"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことわかってて、決意して、やりたいことしに東京に来たことだし、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のねっ支えは、\nメンバーと一緒にいるとき、なんにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話がなくたって隣にいるだけでホッコリする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話がないときはほぼないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるときぐらいだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして家族や友達と会ったり連絡とったりするとき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなによりめっちゃくちゃ大好きな........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂family"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/2313552/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"br